            "content": "All Horcruxes begin off the board. When one is defeated, return it to the box.\nOnce placed on the board, Horcruxes may be moved as a part of Voldemort's maneuver.\nHorcruxes must be dealt damage to be defeated. In that sense, each Horcrux behaves as a 1-health sidekick.\nAs long as there is one Horcrux on the board, Voldemort's health cannot go below 1."
